{"text":"purananuru","n":294,"lines":["வெண்குடை மதியம் மேல்நிலாத் திகழ்தரக்","கண்கூடு இறுத்த கடல்மருள் பாசறைக்","குமரிப்படை தழீஇய கூற்றுவினை ஆடவர்","தமர்பிறர் அறியா அமர்மயங்கு அழுவத்து","இறையும் பெயரும் தோற்றி நுமருள்","நாள்முறை தபுத்தீர் வம்மின் ஈங்கு எனப்","போர்மலைந்து ஒருசிறை நிற்ப யாவரும்","அரவுஉமிழ் மணியின் குறுகார்","நிரைதார் மார்பின்நின் கேள்வனைப் பிறரே"],"tr":["veṇkuṭai matiyam mēlnilāt tikaḻtarak","kaṇkūṭu iṟutta kaṭalmaruḷ pācaṟaik","kumarippaṭai taḻīiya kūṟṟuviṉai āṭavar","tamarpiṟar aṟiyā amarmayaṅku aḻuvattu","iṟaiyum peyarum tōṟṟi numaruḷ","nāḷmuṟai taputtīr vammiṉ īṅku eṉap","pōrmalaintu oruciṟai niṟpa yāvarum","aravuumiḻ maṇiyiṉ kuṟukār","niraitār mārpiṉniṉ kēḷvaṉaip piṟarē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"tumpai","tinai_ta":"தும்பை","turai_ta":"தானை மறம்","poet_ta":"பெருந்தலைச் சாத்தனார்","poet_tr":"Peruntalaic Cāttaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"8×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 31, veṇcīr 3, vañcicīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 17, veṇṭaḷai 15, oṉṟiya vañcittaḷai 1, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"வெண்குடை","tr":"veṇkuṭai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குடை","tr":"kuṭai"}]},{"text":"மதியம்","tr":"matiyam","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மதி","tr":"mati"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யம்","tr":"yam"}]},{"text":"மேல்நிலாத்","tr":"mēlnilāt","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மேல்","tr":"mēl"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிலாத்","tr":"nilāt"}]},{"text":"திகழ்தரக்","tr":"tikaḻtarak","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திகழ்","tr":"tikaḻ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தரக்","tr":"tarak"}]}],[{"text":"கண்கூ","tr":"kaṇkū","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"}]},{"text":"டிறுத்த","