"gloss":"death-dealing work"},{"surface":"ஆடவர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆடவர்","lemma":"āṭavar","gloss":"warriors"}],"gloss":"warriors"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தமர்பிறர்","parts":[{"text":"தமர்","lemma":"tamar","gloss":"one's own people"},{"text":"பிறர்","lemma":"piṟar","gloss":"others"}],"gloss":"kinsmen and strangers"},{"surface":"அறியா","parts":[{"text":"அறியா","lemma":"aṟiyā","gloss":"not knowing"}],"gloss":"indistinguishable"},{"surface":"அமர்மயங்கு","parts":[{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"amar","gloss":"battle"},{"text":"மயங்கு","lemma":"mayaṅku","gloss":"confused"}],"gloss":"battle-mingled"},{"surface":"அழுவத்து","parts":[{"text":"அழுவத்து","lemma":"அழுவத்து","gloss":"in the expanse"}],"gloss":"in the expanse","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இறையும்","parts":[{"text":"இறை","lemma":"iṟai","gloss":"king"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"king and"},{"surface":"பெயரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்","lemma":"peyar","gloss":"name"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"name and"},{"surface":"தோற்றி","parts":[{"text":"தோற்றி","lemma":"tōṟṟi","gloss":"declaring"}],"gloss":"declaring"},{"surface":"நுமருள்","parts":[{"text":"நுமர்","lemma":"numar","gloss":"your people"},{"text":"உள்","lemma":"uḷ","gloss":"among"}],"gloss":"among your people"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாள்முறை","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"},{"text":"முறை","lemma":"muṟai","gloss":"turn"}],"gloss":"daily turn of life"},{"surface":"தபுத்தீர்","parts":[{"text":"தபுத்தீர்","lemma":"taputtīr","gloss":"you who have ended"}],"gloss":"you whose lives have ended"},{"surface":"வம்மின்","parts":[{"text":"வம்மின்","lemma":"vammiṉ","gloss":"come"}],"gloss":"come"},{"surface":"ஈங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஈங்கு","lemma":"īṅku","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"போர்மலைந்து","parts":[{"text":"போர்","lemma":"pōr","gloss":"battle"},{"text":"மலைந்து","lemma":"malaiṉtu","gloss":"fighting"}],"gloss":"fighting the battle"},{"surface":"ஒருசிறை","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"oru","gloss":"one"},{"text":"சிறை","lemma":"ciṟai","gloss":"side"}],"gloss":"on one side"},{"surface":"நிற்ப","parts":[{"text":"நிற்ப","lemma":"niṟpa","gloss":"as he stands"}],"gloss":"as he stands"},{"surface":"யாவரும்","parts":[{"text":"யாவர்","lemma":"yāvar","gloss":"anyone"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"all"}],"gloss":"anyone"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரவு","parts":[{"text":"அரவு","lemma":"aravu","gloss":"serpent"}],"gloss":"serpent"},{"surface":"உமிழ்","parts":[{"text":"உமிழ்","lemma":"umiḻ","gloss":"spitting"}],"gloss":"spitting"},{"surface":"மணியின்","parts":[{"text":"மணி","lemma":"maṇi","gloss":"gem"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like the gem"},{"surface":"குறுகார்","parts":[{"text":"குறுகார்","lemma":"kuṟukār","gloss":"they will not approach"}],"gloss":"they will not approach"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிரைதார்","parts":[{"text":"நிரை","lemma":"nirai","gloss":"orderly"},{"text":"தார்","lemma":"tār","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"orderly garland"},{"surface":"மார்பின்","parts":[{"text":"மார்பு","lemma":"mārpu","gloss":"chest"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the chest"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"niṉ","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"கேள்வனை","parts":[{"text":"கேள்வன்","lemma":"kēḷvaṉ","gloss":"husband"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"accusative"}],"gloss":"husband"},{"surface":"பிறரே","parts":[{"text":"பிறர்","lemma":"piṟar","gloss":"others"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"others"}]}],"literal":"While the white umbrella, like the moon, sheds its light from above, / in the ocean-like military camp pitched close together, / where death-dealing warriors embrace the fresh army, / in the expanse of the confused battle where kinsmen and others are indistinguishable, / declaring, \"Reveal your king and your name! Among your people, / those whose daily turn of life has ended, come here!\" / as he stands on one side, fighting the battle, / like the gem spat out by a serpent, they will not approach, / your husband with the garlanded chest, others!","translation":"While the king's white umbrella shines like the moon above, in the ocean-like military camp pitched close together, death-dealing warriors embrace the fresh army. In the vast, chaotic battlefield where kinsmen and strangers cannot be distinguished, your husband stands on one side, fighting. He challenges the enemies, shouting, \"Declare your king and your name! You whose days are numbered, come here!\" Hearing this, others dare not approach your husband of the garlanded chest, just as no one would dare approach the precious gem spat out by a venomous serpent.","modern":"வெண்கொற்றக் குடை நிலா வீசும் சந்திரனைப் போல மேலே விளங்க, கடல் போன்ற நெருங்கிய பாசறையில், எமனைப் போன்ற தொழில் செய்யும் வீரர்கள் புதிய படையைத் தழுவி நிற்கிறார்கள். உறவினரும் பிறரும் யாரென்று அறிய முடியாதபடி போர் மயங்கிய அந்தப் பரந்த போர்க்களத்தில், 'உங்கள் அரசனையும் பெயரையும் சொல்லுங்கள்! உங்களுள் ஆயுள் முடிந்தவர்கள் இங்கே வாருங்கள்!' என்று சவால் விட்டு, போரிட்டு ஒரு பக்கத்தில் அவன் நிற்கும்போது, மாலை அணிந்த மார்பினை உடைய உன் கணவனை, பாம்பு உமிழ்ந்த நாகமணியை நெருங்க அஞ்சுவது போல, பகைவர்கள் யாரும் நெருங்க மாட்டார்கள்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Tumpai tiṇai (battle of strength) and the theme is Tāṉai Maṟam (the valor of the army/warrior). The poet, Peruntalaic Cāttaṉār, addresses the wife of a brave warrior, praising her husband's extraordinary courage on the battlefield. He describes the chaotic battlefield, resembling a vast ocean, where the king's white umbrella shines like the moon. Amidst the confusion where friend and foe cannot be distinguished, her husband stands defiantly on one side, challenging the enemy forces to step forward if their days are numbered. The poet uses a striking simile: just as people fear to approach the glowing gem spat out by a deadly serpent, the enemies dare not approach her husband because of his terrifying valor.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,3.4],[3.4,3.4],[3.4,4.2],[4.2,4.9],[4.9,5.7],[5.7,5.9],[5.9,6.7],[6.7,7.0],[7.0,8.3],[8.3,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,9.7],[9.7,10.8],[10.8,11.2],[11.2,11.44],[11.48,11.8],[11.8,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.3,13.7],[13.7,13.7],[13.7,14.3],[14.3,15.2],[15.2,15.8],[15.8,15.9],[15.9,16.3],[16.3,16.3],[16.3,18.2],[18.2,18.4],[19.36,20.06],[20.06,20.66],[20.66,21.14],[21.14,21.46]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.8],[1.8,2.1],[2.1,3.5],[3.5,3.6],[3.6,4.5],[4.5,5.14],[5.14,6.09],[6.09,6.4],[6.4,7.0],[7.0,7.5],[7.5,8.15],[8.15,8.37],[8.37,10.33],[10.33,10.84],[10.84,11.6],[11.6,12.0],[12.0,12.36],[12.42,12.9],[12.9,14.5],[14.5,14.9],[15.0,15.6],[15.6,15.7],[15.7,16.3],[16.3,17.6],[17.6,18.4],[18.4,18.5],[18.5,18.8],[18.8,20.5],[20.5,20.9],[20.9,21.1],[22.08,22.98],[22.98,23.48],[23.48,24.18],[24.18,24.58]]},"sync":[[["வெண்குடை","white umbrella"]],[["மதியம்","moon"]],[["மேல்நிலா","moonlight above"],["திகழ்தர","shining"]],[["திகழ்தர","shining"]],[["கண்கூடு","close together"]],[["இறுத்த","pitched"]],[["கடல்மருள்","resembling the ocean"]],[["பாசறை","military camp"]],[["குமரிப்படை","fresh army"]],[["தழீஇய","embracing"]],[["கூற்றுவினை","death-dealing work"]],[["ஆடவர்","warriors"]],[["தமர்பிறர்","kinsmen and strangers"]],[["அறியா","indistinguishable"]],[["அமர்மயங்கு","battle-mingled"]],[["அழுவத்து","in the expanse"]],[["இறையும்","king and"]],[["பெயரும்","name and"]],[["தோற்றி","declaring"]],[["நுமருள்","among your people"]],[["நாள்முறை","daily turn of life"]],[["தபுத்தீர்","you whose lives have ended"]],[["வம்மின்","come"]],[["ஈங்கு","here"]],[["என","saying"]],[["போர்மலைந்து","fighting the battle"]],[["ஒருசிறை","on one side"]],[["நிற்ப","as he stands"]],[["யாவரும்","anyone"]],[["அரவு","serpent"],["உமிழ்","spitting"]],[["மணியின்","like the gem"]],[["குறுகார்","they will not approach"]],[["நிரைதார்","orderly garland"]],[["ம